<%- include('partials/head', { bodyClass: 'public-page' }) %>
<main class="public-shell">
  <nav class="public-nav">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <span class="brand-mark">E</span>
      <span><strong>Epay</strong><small>Test Gateway</small></span>
    </a>
    <div class="public-nav-actions">
      <a class="button button-ghost" href="/api.php?act=order">API</a>
      <a class="button button-dark" href="<%= hasUserSession ? '/admin' : '/admin/login' %>"><%= hasUserSession ? '进入用户中心' : '用户登录' %></a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="status-dot">自托管 · Docker Ready</span>
      <h1>专为支付联调<br><em>Epay 网关</em></h1>
      <p>兼容常见 Epay MD5 签名流程，内置虚拟卡、卡 BIN、3DS 密码、余额、订单超时、模拟拒付和异步回调。不会连接真实银行。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary button-large" href="<%= hasUserSession ? '/admin' : '/admin/login' %>">打开用户中心</a>
        <a class="button button-ghost button-large" href="/healthz">健康检查</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-points">
        <span>✓ Docker Compose 一键部署</span>
        <span>✓ SQLite 持久化</span>
        <span>✓ Epay 标准签名</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-card" aria-label="Epay API 示例">
      <div class="terminal-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>merchant integration</span></div>
      <pre><code>POST /api.php?act=order
  pid         = 1001
  out_trade_no= ORDER-001
  money       = 10.00
  type        = alipay
  bind_card   = 可选

<span class="terminal-good">→ 302 /pay/T2026... 登录选卡/直接绑卡</span>
<span class="terminal-good">← trade_status = TRADE_SUCCESS</span></code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-number">01</span>
      <h2>虚拟卡实验台</h2>
      <p>管理员创建 BIN 并管理余额；普通用户创建自己的虚拟卡并用于支付，账号之间数据隔离。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-number">02</span>
      <h2>可控支付结果</h2>
      <p>已绑定订单只接受指定卡片；未绑定时支持登录选卡，或通过卡号、有效期和 CVV 绑卡。3DS 可开关，并支持拒付、余额不足和卡过期。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="feature-number">03</span>
      <h2>标准回调</h2>
      <p>成功、失败和超时均可生成带签名的异步通知，并按原网站地址返回商户。</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="endpoint-panel">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">ENDPOINTS</p>
      <h2>商户接入入口</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="endpoint-list">
      <div><code>/submit.php</code><span>浏览器跳转支付</span></div>
      <div><code>/api.php</code><span>JSON 创建订单</span></div>
      <div><code>/mapi.php</code><span>JSON API 别名</span></div>
      <div><code>/healthz</code><span>容器健康检查</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<footer class="public-footer">
  <span>Epay Test Gateway · 仅用于测试环境</span>
  <span><%= merchantCount %> 个可用商户</span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
